@title Options at a glance
# Options at a glance

data cost = tier,usd; Basic,1200; Plus,2600; Pro,5400
data seats = tier,seats; Basic,10; Plus,25; Pro,60

grid 3
Basic fits a small crew that wants one shared calendar, a single inbox and nothing else to maintain over the year.

Plus adds route planning, driver handoffs and a weekly summary that goes to the owner without anyone building it.

Pro covers several depots, custom reports, audit exports and a named contact who answers within one working hour.

grid 2
chart bar cost unit=$ title="Yearly cost"
chart bar seats title="Seats included"

grid 2
table = size,price; Small,1200; Large,5400
! Prices exclude tax and the setup fee that applies to the first year only.
